   "date": "2021-03-22",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Charter of Budget Honesty Amendment (Rural and Regional Australia Statements) Bill 2021 would require the Treasurer to publicly release a regional statement with each budget and economic outlook, assessing the impact of government decisions on regional Australia. The speaker noted that regional Australia contributes approximately 40% of national economic output and employs one-third of the workforce, and highlighted challenges in health and education access."
  }
